A container whose table ends on a continuation row

```
- | a |
  + b |
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a b</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
- | a |
  | b |
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a</td></tr>
        <tr><td>b</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
> | a |
> + b |
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>a b</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
> | a |
> | b |
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>a</td></tr>
      <tr><td>b</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
:: t
:  > | a |
   > + b |
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <blockquote>
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>a b</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </blockquote>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
:: t
:  | a |
   + b |
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>a b</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
- a
  + b |
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>a
+ b |
tail</li>
</ul>
```
